Chapter: EffectDottedDeny
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Lattice probe, wrong direction (EffectRows.md stage 0). A def
 declares the sub-effect [Console.Write] but performs print-line-uni,
 whose effect is the broader Console. Console is NOT covered by
 Console.Write (the prefix relation only widens child to parent),
 so this must fail with CDX2031 today and under rows alike.

Section: Definitions

  narrow : Text -> [Console.Write] Nothing
  narrow (t) = print-line-uni t

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    narrow "hello"
  end
